    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      299.2,
      526.29,
      312.48
    ],
    "text": "The Petitioner to this Writ Application joined the Police Department as a Reserve Police",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      326.8,
      526.42,
      340.08
    ],
    "text": "Constable on 13.11.1989 and on 24.09.1997 absorbed into the regular service. A",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      354.4,
      526.37,
      367.68
    ],
    "text": "domestic inquiry was held against him based on an allegation that while he was serving",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      382.0,
      526.23,
      395.28
    ],
    "text": "at the Talawakele Police Station he had claimed the reward money in respect of raids",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      409.6,
      526.31,
      422.88
    ],
    "text": "that he had not participated in the years 2009 to 2011 (brief of the domestic inquiry is",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      437.2,
      526.33,
      450.48
    ],
    "text": "marked as A6). At the inquiry, the Petitioner admitted that he had committed the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      464.82,
      526.4,
      478.1
    ],
    "text": "wrongful acts alleged against him. Thereafter, on 09.03.2012, the Petitioner had been",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      492.42,
      526.42,
      505.7
    ],
    "text": "issued with a charge sheet (marked as Annexure I to the document marked as A-1)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      520.02,
      526.42,
      533.3
    ],
    "text": "containing five charges based on the alleged acts of misconduct and accordingly a",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      547.62,
      526.36,
      560.9
    ],
    "text": "formal disciplinary inquiry was held. At the formal disciplinary inquiry, on behalf of",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      575.22,
      526.37,
      588.5
    ],
    "text": "the prosecution, four witnesses and 10 documents were led in evidence. For the defence,",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      602.82,
      526.34,
      616.1
    ],
    "text": "neither the Petitioner gave evidence nor any other evidence led. At the end of the formal",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      630.42,
      526.41,
      643.7
    ],
    "text": "disciplinary inquiry, the Petitioner was found guilty to 4 charges, namely (i)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      658.05,
      526.41,
