    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      99.73,
      526.09,
      113.01
    ],
    "text": "decision on evidence means no more than it must be based upon material which tends",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      127.33,
      526.24,
      140.61
    ],
    "text": "logically to show the existence or non-existence of facts relevant to the issue to be",
