      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      502.14,
      526.12,
      515.42
    ],
    "text": "reliability. \u2026. The quintessence of the judicial approach is objectivity, preclusion of",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      529.74,
      526.32,
      543.02
    ],
